  (text "SAFETY SWITCH - one switch for the whole array, fanned out to all three.\\nWARNING: on a stock module J702's SAFETY pin lands on U801.PB5, the IO\\nco-processor, which this project's FMU-only firmware never runs. Wiring this\\ndoes nothing until either the IO chip is brought into scope or SAFETY is\\nrouted to a spare FMU GPIO. Provisioned, not functional." (at 177.8 175.26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 9b03e5e6-98a1-43e7-8b4d-84b194c3d7c2)
